          1240
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## Inside the box\n\nThe pills beside the Filter and the Sort \u2014 `orders \u2192` and `\u2192 paid orders`\n\u2014 are the box's ports. A wire to one is a real wire to the node behind it,\nso this runs exactly as it did before it was a box.",
          "width": 440,
          "height": 140
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null,
